// Branch coverage for git: the package's own tests, and nothing else.
//
//   wac task coverage:git
//   wac task coverage:git --verbose
//
// One of the last packages `issues/system/0205` records as unmeasured, and notable for having **no
// programs in `src/`** — every file is a library and every test imports it. Nine packages into this
// sweep that is worth saying out loud, because the three lowest first runs so far were all caused by
// the opposite.

